{
  "productSlug": "freshcaller",
  "shortDescription": "Freshcaller is Freshworks’ cloud PBX for voice support teams. It is unusual in this cluster for publishing a $0 agent tier (pay per minute only) and for bundling included incoming minutes into each paid tier — 2,000 on Growth, 3,000 on Pro, 5,000 on Enterprise. Routing depth climbs with the ladder (wait queues and recording on Growth, routing automation and conferencing on Pro, speech-enabled IVR and service-level monitoring on Enterprise), and day passes let occasional agents log in without a full seat.",
